 each other and how they are related to other parts of the codebase.\n\n\nHere is the information about the current task:\n1. Unique artifacts (obtained through Software Reconnaissance-style analysis):\n# Unique Artifacts\n\nUse these unique artifacts as supplemental hints, not as final answers.\n\n## Summary\n- Trace A role: `feature_positive`\n- Trace B role: `feature_negative`\n- Comparison: `trace_a_minus_trace_b`\n- Unique functions in JSON: `708`\n- Unique functions shown here: `14`\n- Target package filter: `sklearn`\n\n## Related Files\n- `sklearn/calibration.py`: `5` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/linear_model/_base.py`: `2` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/metrics/_plot/base.py`: `2` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/base.py`: `1` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/linear_model/_logistic.py`: `1` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/preprocessing/_label.py`: `1` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/utils/__init__.py`: `1` unique function(s)\n- `sklearn/utils/validation.py`: `1` unique function(s)\n\n## Artifact Candidates\n- artifact: `sklearn/preprocessing/_label.py:label_binarize`\n  - module: `sklearn.preprocessing._label`\n  - definition: `lines 419-585`\n  - first observed in trace A: `line 479`\n  - observed lines: `479, 482, 486, 493, 502, 503, 506, 507, ...`\n  - trace activity: 38 events, 1 calls, 36 line events, 1 returns, 0 exceptions, max depth 4\n  - sample executed lines:\n    - `line 479`: `if not isinstance(y, list):`\n    - `line 482`: `y = check_array(y, accept_sparse=\"csr\", ensure_2d=False, dtype=None)`\n    - `line 486`: `if neg_label >= pos_label:`\n- artifact: `sklearn/utils/validation.py:check_is_fitted`\n  - module: `sklearn.utils.validation`\n  - definition: `lines 1138-1207`\n  - first observed in trace A: `line 1184`\n  - observed lines: `1184, 1186, 1187, 1188, 1192, 1195, 1199, 1202, ...`\n  - trace activity: 26 events, 2 calls, 22 line events, 2 returns, 0 exceptions, max depth 6\n  - sample executed lines:\n    - `line 1184`: `if isclass(estima